mutability.bas:5:1: a is a let: it can't change
  a = 2
  ^
mutability.bas:7:1: C is a const: it can't change
  C += 1
  ^
mutability.bas:9:5: n is a parameter: make it mut to change it
      n = 1
      ^
mutability.bas:12:5: i is the loop's counter: it can't change
      i = 5
      ^
mutability.bas:18:3: a is a let: it can't change
  g(a)
    ^
mutability.bas:19:3: mut takes a var
  g(1 + 2)
    ^
mutability.bas:23:6: v is lent mut in this call
  h(v, v)
       ^
mutability.bas:25:3: mut n is an int, not a double
  g(d)
    ^
mutability.bas:26:3: mut is written on the parameter only: pass v as it is
  g(mut v)
    ^
